{"words": [{"text": "وَمِمَّنْ", "translation": "And of (those) whom"}, {"text": "خَلَقْنَآ", "translation": "We have created"}, {"text": "أُمَّةٌۭ", "translation": "(is) a nation"}, {"text": "يَهْدُونَ", "translation": "who guides"}, {"text": "بِٱلْحَقِّ", "translation": "with the truth"}, {"text": "وَبِهِۦ", "translation": "and thereby"}, {"text": "يَعْدِلُونَ", "translation": "they establish justice"}], "sahih": "And among those We created is a community1 which guides by truth and thereby establishes justice."}